    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/0f3b7d563606f49ac8c3311aacc55f93.avif?t=1659645152\" /></div><br><br>In a world where dodgeball is life, you join Otto at the academy and train to become the ultimate dodgeball champion. Across eight episodes, you\u2019ll forge friendships and create rivals, all in the name of developing the best dodgeball team. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Level up Otto and develop a dynamic team across a vast and customizable party progression system. All the while, explore the vast Dodgeball Academia and uncover the long hidden truths that reside within the very walls you live, learn, and dominate in. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore and uncover the secrets of the Dodgeball Academia across its vast, diverse, and full of life campus<br></li><li>Journey through a full-blown RPG story mode; complete with episodes, main quests, side quests, and school minigames<br></li><li>Unlock and upgrade unique characters, diversifying your dodgeball team through an RPG style character and party progression <br></li><li>Engage in action-packed dodgeball matches featuring a unique fighting game style that will put you up against challenging enemies and bosses<br></li><li>Duke it out with a friend locally in a competitive local versus mode</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/0f3b7d563606f49ac8c3311aacc55f93.avif?t=1659645152\" /></div><br><br>In a world where dodgeball is life, you join Otto at the academy and train to become the ultimate dodgeball champion. Across eight episodes, you\u2019ll forge friendships and create rivals, all in the name of developing the best dodgeball team. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/b2132518ae310aba1d001bae8bc1d86b.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Level up Otto and develop a dynamic team across a vast and customizable party progression system. All the while, explore the vast Dodgeball Academia and uncover the long hidden truths that reside within the very walls you live, learn, and dominate in. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/a9e314af4528cd9f7e81e0fec94c5509.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore and uncover the secrets of the Dodgeball Academia across its vast, diverse, and full of life campus<br></li><li>Journey through a full-blown RPG story mode; complete with episodes, main quests, side quests, and school minigames<br></li><li>Unlock and upgrade unique characters, diversifying your dodgeball team through an RPG style character and party progression <br></li><li>Engage in action-packed dodgeball matches featuring a unique fighting game style that will put you up against challenging enemies and bosses<br></li><li>Duke it out with a friend locally in a competitive local versus mode</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.poster.avif?t=1659645152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.webm?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422420/extras/915d2389db63ab0057e82065f4dcc773.mp4?t=1659645152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Dodgeball Academia is a sports RPG game featuring rookie dodgeball student, Otto. Join Otto and an eclectic cast of characters as they train to dominate on and off the courts of the academia.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cWith engaging dodgeball gameplay and enthralling RPG elements, Dodgeball Academia is one of the best games of the year so far.\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 God is a Geek<br><br>\u201cDodgeball Academia is a champion in its field. It provides the best parts of sports RPGs with cheeky characters, flashy special moves, and gameplay that\u2019s fun to master.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Game Informer<br><br>\u201cDodgeball Academia hits the mark in almost every way.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 GameCritics<br>",
